{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Gemini 全模型接口（OpenAI 兼容格式）",
    "description": "Gemini 全系列文本模型的统一 OpenAI 兼容接口，通过 model 参数选择具体模型，支持文本与图像输入。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/chat/completions": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Gemini 对话补全（全模型）",
        "description": "通过请求体中的 `model` 选择要调用的 Gemini 文本模型（全部可选值见 `model` 参数的对照表）。\n\n- 使用 OpenAI SDK / Chat Completions 格式，同步返回对话内容\n- **纯文本 / 多模态输入**：文本 + 图像混合输入（`messages[].content`）\n- **流式**：设置 `stream: true` 逐块返回\n\n---\n\n**模型规格与差异**\n- **3.8 行为**：相比 3.7，软件工程、Agent、多步推理与多模态准确率更强；模型可能消耗更多推理 / 输出 Token，尤其在 `high` 档。延迟敏感场景建议用 `low`，通用场景用默认 `medium`，复杂代码、长视频或多步推理再用 `high`。\n- **Gemini 4 Argon 行为**：`reasoning_effort` 可选 `low` / `medium` / `high`，不传时由模型自行决定思考量；`minimal` 会被自动降级为 `low`。控制输出长度请使用 `max_tokens`；当前 Gemini 路由无法保证 `max_completion_tokens` 生效。`max_tokens` 可设到 1,048,576，但单次流式请求最多返回 65,536 个思考与回答 token，非流式最多 32,768，到上限时 `finish_reason` 为 `length`。OpenAI 兼容格式不支持长输出续写，需要更长的输出请改用[原生 API 的长输出续写](/cn/api-manual/language-series/gemini/native-api/native-api-reference)。`extra_body.google.thinking_config.thinking_budget` 对该模型不生效。工具调用多轮时，上一轮 `tool_calls[]` 中返回的 `thought_signature` 必须原样带回，否则返回 400。\n- **采样 / 惩罚参数** `temperature` / `top_p` / `frequency_penalty` / `presence_penalty`：Gemini 3.x 全系一致，自定义值不影响输出；`temperature` / `top_p` 超范围返回 400，`frequency_penalty` / `presence_penalty` 传入不生效（会被忽略，不报错）。\n- **思考控制** `reasoning_effort`：`minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high`（各模型支持档位与默认见 `reasoning_effort` 参数）；仅 Gemini 3.x / 4 系列生效。`gemini-4-argon`、`gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.7-flash` 与 Pro 系不支持 `minimal`，传入会被自动降级为 `low`。\n- **末轮角色**：最后一条消息的 `role` 不能为 `assistant`（Gemini 3.5+ 会报错）。\n- **Token 上限**：`gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.7-flash` / `gemini-3.6-flash` / `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` 上下文 1,048,576、最大输出 65,536；`gemini-4-argon` 上下文 1,048,576（输入、思考与输出共用），单次流式请求最多输出 65,536、非流式 32,768（均含思考 + 回答），实际输出还受共享上下文剩余空间限制，本格式不支持续写；其余模型以各自规格为准。\n- **Gemini 2.5 旧 ID**：2026-10-19 起 `gemini-2.5-pro` / `gemini-2.5-flash` / `gemini-2.5-flash-lite` 分别由 `gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` / `gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview` 处理并按其价格计费；响应里显示新模型 ID，参数行为以新模型为准。`extra_body.google.thinking_config.thinking_budget` 会换算成 `reasoning_effort`（见 `extra_body`）。",
        "operationId": "geminiChatCompletions",
        "tags": [
          "对话生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple_text": {
                  "summary": "单轮文本对话",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.6-flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "请介绍一下你自己"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "多轮对话（上下文理解）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.6-flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "什么是Python？"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "Python是一种高级编程语言..."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "它有什么优点？"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "使用系统提示词",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.6-flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "system",
                        "content": "你是一个专业的Python编程助手，用简洁的语言回答问题。"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "如何读取文件？"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "vision": {
                  "summary": "多模态输入（文本 + 图像）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.6-flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "请详细描述这张图片中的场景和主要元素。"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image_url",
                            "image_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/image.png"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi_image": {
                  "summary": "多图片输入",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.6-flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "对比这两张图片的区别"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image_url",
                            "image_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/image1.png"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image_url",
                            "image_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/image2.png"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "output_limit": {
                  "summary": "限制输出长度（Gemini 4 Argon，可能截断）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-4-argon",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Output integers 1 through 100, one per line. Start immediately."
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_tokens": 64,
                    "reasoning_effort": "low"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "对话生成成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "Insufficient quota",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "https://evolink.ai/dashboard/credits"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "Access denied for this model",
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "param": "model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "资源不存在",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "Specified model not found",
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "param": "model",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "gemini-3.6-flash"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "请求体过大",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 413,
                    "message": "Image file too large",
                    "type": "request_too_large_error",
                    "param": "content",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "compress image to under 10MB"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 60 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "internal_server_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try again later"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "上游服务错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "Upstream AI service unavailable",
                    "type": "upstream_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try different model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "Service temporarily unavailable",
                    "type": "service_unavailable_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 30 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ChatCompletionRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "选择要调用的 Gemini 文本模型：\n\n| 模型 ID | 系列 | 定位 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `gemini-4-argon` | 4 Argon | 长报告与大型代码任务；单次流式最多 65,536 / 非流式 32,768 Token；更长输出需改用原生 API 续写 |\n| `gemini-3.8-flash` | 3.8 Flash | 增强的软件工程 / Agent / 多步推理 / 多模态准确率 |\n| `gemini-3.7-flash` | 3.7 Flash | Pro 级 agentic / 代码生成 / 终端执行 |\n| `gemini-3.6-flash` | 3.6 Flash | 多步编排 / 代码重构 / 通用推理 |\n| `gemini-3.5-flash` | 3.5 Flash | 通用 Flash |\n| `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` | 3.5 Flash-Lite | 低成本 / 高吞吐 / 轻量 agent |\n| `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` | 3.1 Pro (Preview) | 高级推理 |\n| `gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools` | 3.1 Pro · CustomTools | 高级推理 + 自定义工具 |\n| `gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview` | 3.1 Flash-Lite (Preview) | 低成本 |\n| `gemini-3-pro-preview` | 3.0 Pro (Preview) | 高级推理 |\n| `gemini-3-flash-preview` | 3.0 Flash (Preview) | 通用 Flash |\n| `gemini-2.5-pro` | 2.5 Pro | 旧 ID；2026-10-19 起由 `gemini-3.8-flash` 处理，按其价格计费 |\n| `gemini-2.5-flash` | 2.5 Flash | 旧 ID；2026-10-19 起由 `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` 处理，按其价格计费 |\n| `gemini-2.5-flash-lite` | 2.5 Flash-Lite | 旧 ID；2026-10-19 起由 `gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview` 处理，按其价格计费 |",
            "enum": [
              "gemini-4-argon",
              "gemini-3.8-flash",
              "gemini-3.7-flash",
              "gemini-3.6-flash",
              "gemini-3.5-flash",
              "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
              "gemini-3.1-pro-preview",
              "gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools",
              "gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview",
              "gemini-3-pro-preview",
              "gemini-3-flash-preview",
              "gemini-2.5-pro",
              "gemini-2.5-flash",
              "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
            ],
            "example": "gemini-3.6-flash"
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "对话消息列表，支持多轮对话和多模态输入",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Message"
            },
            "minItems": 1
          },
          "stream": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否以流式方式返回响应\n\n- `true`: 流式返回，逐块实时返回内容\n- `false`: 等待完整响应后一次性返回",
            "example": false,
            "default": false
          },
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "生成回复的最大 token 数量，包含思考与回答。当前 Gemini 路由请使用此参数控制输出长度。\n\n`gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.7-flash` / `gemini-3.6-flash` / `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` 上限 65,536 tokens；`gemini-4-argon` 参数可设到 1,048,576，但单次流式最多返回 65,536、非流式 32,768，实际输出还受共享上下文剩余空间限制。达到输出上限时 `finish_reason` 为 `length`，本格式不支持续写。其余模型以各自规格为准。",
            "minimum": 1,
            "example": 2000,
            "maximum": 1048576
          },
          "max_completion_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "OpenAI 兼容字段。当前 Gemini 路由无法保证此字段限制输出长度，可能返回超过设置值的内容；控制输出长度请改用 `max_tokens`。",
            "minimum": 1,
            "example": 2000,
            "maximum": 1048576,
            "deprecated": true
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "采样温度，控制输出的随机性\n\n**说明**:\n- 较低值(如 0.2): 更确定、更聚焦的输出\n- 较高值(如 1.5): 更随机、更有创意的输出\n\n**Gemini 3.x 全系一致**（不因模型而异）：合法范围内的自定义值不影响输出；超出该参数合法范围会返回 400，而非静默忽略。",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "example": 0.7,
            "default": 1
          },
          "top_p": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "核采样(Nucleus Sampling)参数\n\n**说明**:\n- 控制从累积概率前多少的token中采样\n- 例如 0.9 表示从累积概率达到90%的token中选择\n- 默认值: 0.95\n\n**建议**: 不要同时调整 temperature 和 top_p\n\n**Gemini 3.x 全系一致**（不因模型而异）：合法范围内的自定义值不影响输出；超出该参数合法范围会返回 400，而非静默忽略。",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "example": 0.9,
            "default": 0.95
          },
          "frequency_penalty": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "重复 token 惩罚系数，范围 -2 到 2，对应 Gemini 的 frequencyPenalty。\n\n**Gemini 3.x / 4 全系一致**：传入会被忽略、不生效（不报错）。",
            "minimum": -2,
            "maximum": 2,
            "default": 0,
            "example": 0
          },
          "presence_penalty": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "已出现 token 惩罚系数，范围 -2 到 2，对应 Gemini 的 presencePenalty。\n\n**Gemini 3.x / 4 全系一致**：传入会被忽略、不生效（不报错）。",
            "minimum": -2,
            "maximum": 2,
            "default": 0,
            "example": 0
          },
          "stop": {
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "停止序列，支持字符串或字符串数组，对应 Gemini 的 stopSequences。",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "n": {
            "type": "integer",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "生成候选数量\n\nGemini 3.x 仅支持 `1`；传入 >1 会返回 400（等同 native 已移除的 `candidateCount`）。\n\n`gemini-4-argon`：传入 >1 不报错，只返回 1 个候选。",
            "minimum": 1,
            "default": 1,
            "example": 1,
            "maximum": 1
          },
          "reasoning_effort": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "限制思考工作量，对应 Gemini 的思考层级：\n- `minimal`：近乎零思考，高吞吐 / 低延迟\n- `low`：较少思考，简单任务\n- `medium`：质量与速度均衡\n- `high`：深度多步推理\n\n**Gemini 3.x / 4 系列生效**，各模型支持的档位与默认不同（与原生一致）：\n\n| 模型 | 支持档位 | 默认 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `gemini-4-argon` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | 不传时由模型自行决定 |\n| `gemini-3.8-flash` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | `medium` |\n| `gemini-3.7-flash` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | `medium` |\n| `gemini-3.6-flash` | `minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high` | `medium` |\n| `gemini-3.5-flash` | `minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high` | `medium` |\n| `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` | `minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high` | `minimal` |\n| `gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview` | `minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high` | `minimal` |\n| `gemini-3-flash-preview` | `minimal` / `low` / `medium` / `high` | `medium` |\n| `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | `high` |\n| `gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | `high` |\n| `gemini-3-pro-preview` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | `high` |\n\n传入模型不支持的档位（如向 Pro 系、`gemini-4-argon` 或 `gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.7-flash` 传 `minimal`）会被自动降级为 `low`，不会报错。",
            "enum": [
              "minimal",
              "low",
              "medium",
              "high"
            ],
            "example": "minimal"
          },
          "seed": {
            "type": "integer",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "用于尽可能复现输出的随机种子，对应 Gemini 的 seed。",
            "example": 12345
          },
          "response_format": {
            "description": "响应格式设置，支持 JSON mode 与 JSON Schema，对应 Gemini 的 responseMimeType、responseSchema 和 responseJsonSchema。",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "json_object"
                    ],
                    "example": "json_object",
                    "description": "响应格式类型。"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "json_schema"
                    ],
                    "example": "json_schema",
                    "description": "响应格式类型。"
                  },
                  "json_schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "nullable": true,
                    "description": "JSON Schema 定义。"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "stream_options": {
            "type": "object",
            "nullable": true,
